# Pre-commit gate, a quick check that the change broke nothing large:
#   1. format:check — Prettier, verify only (run `npm run format` to fix)
#   2. lint         — eslint, one rule: multi-line comments are starred blocks
#   3. test         — golden suite, values only: engine/tests/golden/runAll.ts
#   4. test:unit    — vitest, engine/tests/unit + canon, cade and web unit tests
#
# The slow tests do not run here. The integration tests, the full
# required-inputs check and the PDF fill run on GitHub for each pull request
# (.github/workflows/gates.yml), side by side, and a pull request merges only
# when its "all gates" check is green. Run one locally when you need it:
# `npm run test:integration`, `npm run test:inputs`, `npm run test:pdf`.
#
# Skip with --no-verify if you're committing a deliberate scenario update
# in two stages (expected.ts before fact-fix, or vice versa). Don't make
# that a habit.

npm run format:check
npm run lint
npm test
npm run test:unit
